function boundaryOf(league){const r=resultRound();if(!r)return null;const rows=allRoundResults().filter(x=>x.league===league).sort((a,b)=>scoreNum(b)-scoreNum(a)),count=r.advanceCounts?.[league];
 if(count===undefined||count===null)return {league,kind:'unset',rows};if(count===0||count>=rows.length)return {league,kind:count===0?'none':'all',rows,count};
 const a=rows[count-1],b=rows[count],diff=Math.round((scoreNum(a)-scoreNum(b))*10)/10;return {league,kind:diff<revoteThreshold?'close':'clear',rows,a,b,diff,count};}
